      "value": "[VRChat 2026.3.2 (OPEN BETA)](https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrchat-202632-open-beta) - August 25, `Build 1898`:\n\n> Fixed an issue that could cause the author or avatar name in the profile's avatar panel to be incorrectly truncated when certain characters were used.",
