  "details": "This was taken in U6.\n\nIf an avatar has been uploaded by a user which starts on a non-latin character. This is consistent between all users in the instance. \n\nInstead of name, it just says \"By ...\"\n\nIf the name is starting with latin characters, It writes out the name until the non-latin ones start. Like \"TummyTi....\"\n\nSorry for low quality screenshots.",
